        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>If <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6p + 8 = 26,]</span> what is the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2p - 3?]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "If [MATH: 6p + 8 = 26,] what is the value of [MATH: 2p - 3?]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We are given the equation <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6p + 8 = 26]</span> and are asked to find the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2p - 3.]</span></p><p>First, we solve the equation for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: p{:}]</span>\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 6p + 8|= 26; 6p|= 18; p|= 3]</span></p><p>Now, we substitute <span class=\"math\">[MATH: p = 3]</span> into <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2p - 3{:}]</span>\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2p \u2212 3|= 2(3) \u2212 3; = 6 \u2212 3; = 3]</span></p><p>Therefore, the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2p - 3]</span> is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We are given the equation [MATH: 6p + 8 = 26] and are asked to find the value of [MATH: 2p - 3.]\n\nFirst, we solve the equation for [MATH: p{:}]\n[MATH: 6p + 8|= 26; 6p|= 18; p|= 3]\n\nNow, we substitute [MATH: p = 3] into [MATH: 2p - 3{:}]\n[MATH: 2p \u2212 3|= 2(3) \u2212 3; = 6 \u2212 3; = 3]\n\nTherefore, the value of [MATH: 2p - 3] is [MATH: 3.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
